  "title": "Like No One Else's Fruit Salad Dressing",
  "description": "An unusual, flavorful dressing that will perk up any fruit salad, this is sweet, spicy, and creamy dressing made with eggs, mustard, marshmallows and cream. Odd-sounding combo, but famously tasty result.",
  "authors": [
    "Sheila"
  ],
  "date_published": "2000-08-13T20:33:05-04:00",
  "date_modified": "2022-07-14T17:56:36-04:00",
